    // ================================================================
    // THE WEAPONS MADE OUT OF THE AIR, AND THE PLATE THAT GIVES WAY.
    //
    // The beats the client draws to (VelkharForgeLayer, ShatterGlowLayer) and the server sounds on. One set of
    // numbers for both, so the picture and the sound cannot drift apart - and the clips in
    // tools/gen_models_velkhar.py mirror them (INTRO_*, P2_*, AS_*): if one moves, the other moves with it.
    // ================================================================
    /** The intro: the cold is called on 78; the gate's shards land from 86 and it is SET on 102 (the arm takes its
     *  weight); the roar on 104; the blade's shards from 107, laid from the guard to the point, and the hand
     *  closes on the hilt on 116. */
